     2454         .
     2455       end.
     2456     end.
     2457   end procedure.
     2458   define variable vss-include-info14 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2459   on F2 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere do:
