     2472   define variable vss-include-info17 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2473   on f5 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere
     2474   do:
     2475      v-doc-rec = ?. if available X_wth-pobj then assign v-doc-rec = recid( X_wth-pobj). run openbr in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).                reposition br-wthpobj to recid v-doc-rec no-error. APPLY 'ENTRY' to br-wthpobj. APPLY 'VALUe-CHANGED' to br-wthpobj.
     2476       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to BR-wthpobj.
     2477   end.
     2478   MAIN-BLOCK:
     2479   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     2480      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     2481     if p-rid-list <> "":u then do:
